 "description": "Create an email inbox with optional file storage. Choose username or omit it to generate an address. Optional title defaults to the username. Taken names return EMAIL_ALREADY_EXISTS; reserved platform names return EMAIL_NAME_RESERVED. Returns email.address after receiving is confirmed.",
